  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Apotheosis 是一款經典模組，歷經多個版本的演進，其玩法依然精彩，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">然而許多貼圖與標準的 Minecraft 風格顯得有些脫節……</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現正式推出：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong>Chaotix Apotheotic Tweaks</strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/943/204/64/64/638426293031816002.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這是一款資源包，旨在修正我自己（以及幾位朋友）所指出的一些小問題。</span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/802/5/apoth_preview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"545\" height=\"99\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>警告：若未安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">APOTHEOSIS</a>，此資源包將無法發揮任何作用。<br></strong></span><strong>如果你正在尋找 Fabric 版的 Zenith 版本，請點&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chaotix-zenith-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</strong><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">此資源包幾乎為該模組的每個面向都進行了完全重新貼圖，包括：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 所有（預設）寶石貼圖</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 藥水護符</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 典籍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 稀有度素材</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 自訂箭矢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 小瓶</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">鍛造與拆解介面</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 所有書架（成效參差）</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 鍛造台</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">- 寶石切割台</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">可能還有其他我忘記列出的項目。</span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>歡迎隨時提供建議、回報問題等。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>額外致謝：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadows_of_fire\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shadows_of_Fire</a> 與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faellynna\" rel=\"nofollow\">faellynna</a> 製作 Apotheosis</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;- 協助我進行各項設計決策的朋友們</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;- <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fqdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries Discord</a> 推動我實際製作此資源包，並在過程中提供支持</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你們共同構成了這個奇特專案最初的地基，謝謝大家。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZLOV6Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"762\" height=\"78\"></p>\n<p><br>歡迎將此資源包用於整合包與影片中（只需附上本頁連結即可）</p>\n<p>請勿二次上傳此資源包！</p>",
